{"id": "arch-watch-iphone", "type": "decision", "fact": "Dual-target project: watchOS app (timer + temperature) and iPhone companion (charts + export). Shared data via App Groups + SwiftData.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["architecture", "watchos", "ios"]}
{"id": "api-water-temp", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "CMWaterTemperature only works on physical Apple Watch Ultra/Series 10+. Does NOT work in simulator. Always use mock data for development.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["coreomotion", "testing", "simulator"]}
{"id": "api-healthkit", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "HealthKit permissions must be requested for HKQuantityTypeIdentifier.waterTemperature and .appleExerciseTime. Permission dialogs only show on device.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["healthkit", "permissions"]}
{"id": "api-extended-runtime", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "Watch app needs WKExtendedRuntimeSession for timer to run when display turns off underwater.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["watchos", "background"]}
{"id": "stack-charts", "type": "decision", "fact": "Using Swift Charts (iOS 16+) for temperature trends, duration history, and combined analysis graphs.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["charts", "ios"]}
{"id": "stack-data", "type": "decision", "fact": "SwiftData for local persistence, shared via App Groups between Watch and iPhone targets.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["swiftdata", "persistence"]}
{"id": "market-differentiation", "type": "decision", "fact": "Key differentiators: cold-water only focus (no saunas), no subscription (one-time purchase), Czech/Slovak localization, proper Apple Health export.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["product", "market"]}
{"id": "model-session", "type": "decision", "fact": "Core data model: IceBathSession with id (UUID), date, duration (TimeInterval), minWaterTemp, maxWaterTemp, avgWaterTemp, and optional notes.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["data-model", "swift"]}
{"id": "watchos-sim-companion-deploy", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "xcodebuild test on a watchOS companion app fails with _validateCompanionAppStateInWatchKitApp unless the iPhone companion is built and installed on the paired iPhone simulator first. Boot both simulators, build+install the iOS target, then run watch tests.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["watchos", "simulator", "testing", "xcodebuild"]}
{"id": "xcodegen-entitlements-empty", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "xcodegen entitlements: path: Foo.entitlements (path-only) creates/overwrites the file with an empty <dict/>, silently removing App Groups, HealthKit, and background modes. Always add entitlements: properties: alongside path: so xcodegen writes the keys on every regeneration.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["xcodegen", "entitlements", "app-groups", "healthkit"]}
{"id": "swift6-observable-mainactor-tasks", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "In Swift 6.2 / Xcode 26, nonisolated(unsafe) has no effect on stored properties of @Observable @MainActor classes (compiler warning). nonisolated on mutable stored properties is also rejected by the @Observable macro. Use [weak self] guards inside task loop bodies so tasks exit when the object deallocates — no deinit cancellation needed.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["swift6", "concurrency", "observable", "mainactor"]}
{"id": "cmwatersubmersion-delegate", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "CMWaterSubmersionManagerDelegate has 4 required methods (not @optional). didUpdate measurement: takes CMWaterSubmersionMeasurement (not CMWaterTemperature). Temperature readings come via func manager(_:didUpdate temperature: CMWaterTemperature). Wrong param type causes silent protocol conformance failure.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["coreomotion", "corewater", "watchos", "delegate"]}
{"id": "watchos-test-bundle-loader", "type": "gotcha", "fact": "watchOS unit test bundles fail to link SwiftUI (cannot link directly with SwiftUICore) unless TEST_HOST and BUNDLE_LOADER point to the watch app binary. Set in xcodegen: TEST_HOST: $(BUILT_PRODUCTS_DIR)/ColdWatch.app/ColdWatch and BUNDLE_LOADER: $(TEST_HOST).", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["watchos", "testing", "xcodegen", "swiftui", "linker"]}
{"id": "mainactor-test-class", "type": "pattern", "fact": "Test classes that test @MainActor @Observable view models must be marked @MainActor at the class level in Swift 6. Otherwise the compiler rejects construction and property access of @MainActor-isolated types from non-isolated test methods.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["swift6", "testing", "mainactor", "observable"]}
{"id": "xcodegen-watchos-companion", "type": "pattern", "fact": "xcodegen watchOS companion project: watch target uses type: application, platform: watchOS + WKApplication: true + WKCompanionAppBundleIdentifier: <iOS bundle ID> in Info.plist. iOS target declares dependencies: - target: ColdWatch embed: true. Without WKCompanionAppBundleIdentifier, xcrun simctl install fails with 'Missing WKCompanionAppBundleIdentifier key'.", "confidence": "high", "tags": ["xcodegen", "watchos", "companion", "project-setup"]}
